blooms, and leave every plant untouched under the conservatory’s garden rules.","short_summary":"A warm, plant-filled indoor outing with distinct greenhouse environments.","evidence_claim":"Baltimore City Parks states that Rawlings Conservatory is free to visitors and accepts optional donations.","source_url":"https://baltimorecityparks.com/druid-hill-park/","source_title":"Druid Hill Park | Baltimore City Parks","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2020-07-07","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Visitor admission is free; donations are optional. Check the conservatory’s current hours and closure notices before visiting.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jhu-regular-season-athletics","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Johns Hopkins Regular-Season Home Athletics","title":"Cheer at a Free Home Game","subtitle":"Most Blue Jays regular-season contests charge no admission","notes":"Check the official schedule, choose a regular-season home contest, and exclude men’s lacrosse, NCAA tournament games, and possible conference-ticketed events.","short_summary":"A campus game-day hang built around a no-admission Blue Jays contest.","evidence_claim":"Johns Hopkins Athletics says admission is not charged for regular-season home events other than men’s lacrosse.","source_url":"https://hopkinssports.com/sports/2018/6/15/frequently-asked-questions.aspx?path=jays-unlimited","source_title":"Frequently Asked Questions - Johns Hopkins University Athletics","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Select a regular-season home event other than men’s lacrosse. NCAA tournament games charge admission, and conference championship events may do so.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"enoch-pratt-central-library-tour","subject_type":"activity","entity_